slug:'fallbrook',name:'Fallbrook',title:'Fallbrook Remodeling: County Permits & Site Feasibility',
intro:'Fallbrook is an unincorporated community. Begin permit and land-use research with San Diego County Planning & Development Services, rather than looking for a City of Fallbrook building department. The County’s Fallbrook page links to community plans and maps.',
sections:[
['Map the usable site before drawing a new room','For a property with a long driveway, changes in grade or existing outbuildings, sketch how equipment and materials will reach the work. Locate utilities and any known easements. These are property-specific planning questions; a Fallbrook mailing address does not mean every lot has the same terrain or service connections.',0],
['If the house uses septic, investigate it early','The County’s septic program reviews repairs and modifications to onsite wastewater systems. Before designing added sleeping space or a second dwelling, take the existing system records and proposed use to the responsible County staff. Determine whether the system and its reserved area affect where the building or construction access can go.',1],
['Check whether a community design overlay actually applies','Fallbrook has County-administered design standards with a defined scope. They should not be presented as a blanket review requirement for every single-family kitchen or bathroom remodel. Use the parcel’s zoning and the proposed use to ask PDS whether a special designator affects the application.',2]
],checklist:['Parcel number and County permit history','Driveway and work-area access sketch','Septic records if the property is not sewer-connected','Location of proposed additions relative to utilities and reserved areas'],question:'Does the Fallbrook planning group issue building permits?',answer:'No. Use County Planning & Development Services for the permit process. Community planning and design-review bodies have advisory roles within the County’s review system.',links:[['Addition planning','home-additions.html'],['ADU feasibility and cost','adu-cost-san-diego.html']],sources:[['County Fallbrook community resources','https://www.sandiegocounty.gov/pds/gpupdate/comm/fallbrook.html'],['County Septic Systems','https://www.sandiegocounty.gov/deh/lwqd/lu_septic_systems.html'],['County Fallbrook Design Standards','https://www.sandiegocounty.gov/content/dam/sdc/pds/drb/Fallbrook_Design_Standards_2024.pdf']]
