['Make staying in the home a design decision','If the purpose of the remodel is easier daily use, trace the route from parking to the bedroom, bathroom and kitchen. Consider doorway clearance, shower entry, lighting controls and storage reach before adding square footage. These are household-specific priorities, not claims about all Rancho Bernardo residents or homes.'],
['Treat association review as a separate workstream','Where an association governs exterior alterations, obtain its rules for windows, equipment and additions while the City permit scope is being established. Put the two sets of decisions on the same schedule. Keep interior selections flexible where they depend on a proposed exterior opening.']
